{
  "_comment": [
    "Per-satellite packet templates (AGENTS.md §14, Phase 4b). Synced to packet_template for catalogued satellites; validated by app/packets/templates.py.",
    "Framing standards are real (AX.25 v2.2, CCSDS 133.0-B-2 space packets, CCSDS 301.0 CUC time). Field layouts are real where layout_sourced is true (CroCube's own amateur-radio document; UWE-4's layout from the decoder SatNOGS runs; APRS text) and illustrative where it is false.",
    "ccsds_bus: the satellites with a published link budget get simulated housekeeping. The layout, APIDs and opcodes are illustrative (no public ICD for their housekeeping or commanding); the values come from the modelled subsystems (sim/subsystems.py). Corruption on the way down follows their real link margin.",
    "satnogs downlink: frames really received by SatNOGS stations, replayed during this station's pass, one per interval_s per template. CroCube's 90 s cadence is from its document; the ISS digipeater (it relays whatever hams send) and UWE-4 replay cadences are modelled.",
    "Commands are simulated (nothing is transmitted). CroCube and UWE-4 publish no command set, so they are receive-only. N0CALL is the conventional placeholder callsign; APZSLB is an APRS experimental destination (APZxxx).",
    "downlink_frequency_hz: the downlink the contact's Doppler shift (and its tone) is computed for, for satellites without a link profile (those use the profile's frequency). Each value cites the satellite's own document or announcement and the SatNOGS DB transmitter, which lists it active."
  ],
  "version": 2,
  "verified_on": "2026-10-29",
  "template_sets": {
    "ccsds_bus": {
      "telemetry": [
        {
          "name": "hk",
          "label": "Housekeeping (illustrative layout, modelled values)",
          "framing": { "type": "ccsds", "apid": 256, "time_code": true, "error_control": true },
          "payload": {
            "encoding": "binary",
            "endian": "be",
            "fields": [
              { "name": "soc_pct", "label": "Battery state of charge", "type": "u8", "scale": 0.5, "unit": "%", "source": "power.soc_pct" },
              { "name": "illumination", "type": "u8", "enum": { "0": "sunlit", "1": "penumbra", "2": "eclipse" }, "source": "power.illumination" },
              { "name": "sunlit_fraction", "type": "u8", "scale": 0.004, "source": "power.sunlit_fraction" },
              { "name": "temperature_c", "label": "Bus temperature", "type": "s16", "scale": 0.01, "unit": "°C", "source": "thermal.temperature_c" },
              { "name": "storage_fill_pct", "type": "u8", "scale": 0.5, "unit": "%", "source": "storage.fill_pct" },
              { "name": "off_nadir_deg", "label": "Station off nadir", "type": "u16", "scale": 0.01, "unit": "°", "source": "attitude.off_nadir_deg" },
              { "name": "beacon_interval_s", "type": "u16", "unit": "s", "source": "comms.beacon_interval_s" },
              { "name": "commands_received", "type": "u16", "source": "comms.commands_received" }
            ]
          },
          "interval_s": 10,
          "downlink": "simulated",
          "layout_sourced": false,
          "sources": [
            { "title": "CCSDS 133.0-B-2, Space Packet Protocol (framing)", "url": "https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/133x0b2e2.pdf" },
            { "title": "CCSDS 301.0-B-4, Time Code Formats (CUC secondary header)", "url": "https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/301x0b4e1.pdf" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "ack",
          "label": "Command acknowledgement (illustrative layout)",
          "framing": { "type": "ccsds", "apid": 257, "time_code": true, "error_control": true },
          "payload": {
            "encoding": "binary",
            "endian": "be",
            "fields": [
              { "name": "command_opcode", "type": "u8", "format": "hex", "source": "command.opcode" },
              { "name": "command_sequence", "type": "u16", "source": "command.sequence" },
              { "name": "status", "type": "u8", "enum": { "0": "accepted" }, "source": "command.status" }
            ]
          },
          "downlink": "simulated",
          "layout_sourced": false,
          "sources": [
            { "title": "CCSDS 133.0-B-2, Space Packet Protocol (framing)", "url": "https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/133x0b2e2.pdf" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "commands": [
        {
          "name": "PING",
          "label": "Ping: the satellite acknowledges",
          "framing": { "type": "ccsds", "apid": 384, "time_code": false, "error_control": true },
          "opcode": 1,
          "response": "ack",
          "response_template": "ack",
          "layout_sourced": false,
          "sources": [{ "title": "CCSDS 133.0-B-2, Space Packet Protocol (framing)", "url": "https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/133x0b2e2.pdf" }]
        },
        {
          "name": "REQUEST_HK",
          "label": "Request housekeeping now",
          "framing": { "type": "ccsds", "apid": 384, "time_code": false, "error_control": true },
          "opcode": 2,
          "response": "telemetry",
          "response_template": "hk",
          "layout_sourced": false,
          "sources": [{ "title": "CCSDS 133.0-B-2, Space Packet Protocol (framing)", "url": "https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/133x0b2e2.pdf" }]
        },
        {
          "name": "SET_BEACON_INTERVAL",
          "label": "Set the housekeeping interval",
          "framing": { "type": "ccsds", "apid": 384, "time_code": false, "error_control": true },
          "opcode": 3,
          "params": [{ "name": "interval_s", "label": "Interval (s)", "type": "int", "min": 10, "max": 120 }],
          "response": "ack",
          "response_template": "ack",
          "effect": "beacon_interval",
          "layout_sourced": false,
          "sources": [{ "title": "CCSDS 133.0-B-2, Space Packet Protocol (framing)", "url": "https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/133x0b2e2.pdf" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    "iss_aprs": {
      "telemetry": [
        {
          "name": "aprs",
          "label": "APRS packet relayed by the ISS digipeater (145.825 MHz, AFSK 1200 bps)",
          "framing": { "type": "ax25", "fcs": false },
          "payload": { "encoding": "aprs" },
          "interval_s": 30,
          "downlink": "satnogs",
          "layout_sourced": true,
          "sources": [
            { "title": "ARRL: simultaneous APRS and voice repeater on the ISS (145.825 MHz; paths RS0ISS, ARISS, APRSAT)", "url": "https://www.arrl.org/news/simultaneous-aprs-and-voice-repeater-on-the-international-space-station" },
            { "title": "AX.25 Link Access Protocol for Amateur Packet Radio, v2.2", "url": "https://www.ax25.net/AX25.2.2-Jul%2098-2.pdf" },
            { "title": "APRS protocol specification (WB2OSZ's APRS 1.2 working edition)", "url": "https://github.com/wb2osz/aprsspec" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "commands": [
        {
          "name": "APRS_MESSAGE",
          "label": "Send an APRS message through the ISS digipeater",
          "framing": {
            "type": "ax25",
            "source": { "callsign": "N0CALL" },
            "destination": { "callsign": "APZSLB" },
            "path": [{ "callsign": "ARISS" }]
          },
          "params": [
            { "name": "addressee", "label": "To (callsign)", "type": "text", "max_length": 9, "charset": "callsign" },
            { "name": "text", "label": "Message", "type": "text", "max_length": 67 }
          ],
          "response": "digipeat",
          "response_delay_s": 0.0,
          "layout_sourced": true,
          "sources": [
            { "title": "ARRL: simultaneous APRS and voice repeater on the ISS (145.825 MHz; paths RS0ISS, ARISS, APRSAT)", "url": "https://www.arrl.org/news/simultaneous-aprs-and-voice-repeater-on-the-international-space-station" },
            { "title": "APRS protocol specification (WB2OSZ's APRS 1.2 working edition)", "url": "https://github.com/wb2osz/aprsspec" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "crocube": {
